usage: verify_knight_causal_run.py [-h] --before-pair BEFORE_PAIR
                                   --after-pair AFTER_PAIR
                                   --before-save BEFORE_SAVE
                                   --after-save AFTER_SAVE --trace TRACE
                                   --rakaly RAKALY --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
                                   --expected-source-head EXPECTED_SOURCE_HEAD
                                   --expected-dll-sha256 EXPECTED_DLL_SHA256
                                   --episode-character-id EPISODE_CHARACTER_ID
                                   --victim VICTIM --related RELATED
                                   [--day-finished DAY_FINISHED]

Verify one exact native knight run and project its full selected saved blocks.
Only existing original request/result JSON, immutable CK3 saves and the pinned
Rakaly decoder are read. No CK3, desktop, provider, Git mutation or network
operation. The new output directory is create-only and keeps successful and
failed assets.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --before-pair BEFORE_PAIR
  --after-pair AFTER_PAIR
  --before-save BEFORE_SAVE
  --after-save AFTER_SAVE
  --trace TRACE
  --rakaly RAKALY
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --expected-source-head EXPECTED_SOURCE_HEAD
  --expected-dll-sha256 EXPECTED_DLL_SHA256
  --episode-character-id EPISODE_CHARACTER_ID
  --victim VICTIM
  --related RELATED
  --day-finished DAY_FINISHED
                        Required for explicit-binding saved-pair input; exact
                        unique one-day-finished.json original.
